{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122113","id":4209330169,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc765Uf5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122113","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122113.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122113.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122113","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122113/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122113/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122113/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1b591fb5631d496442696c2a11b0d6394d577853","number":122113,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Confirm that input object for `tween_property` has not been deleted and emit an error if it has","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122096\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nWith this PR, if `tween_property()` is called and the `Object` passed in has been deleted or queued for deletion, the `PropertyTweener` will not be created and an error will be emitted, rather than the game crashing.\r\n\r\nThe second condition in the error check:\r\n```cpp\r\n!p_target->is_ref_counted() && ObjectDB::get_instance(p_target->get_instance_id()) == nullptr\r\n```\r\nseemed to be necessary to catch a race condition. Without it, the game would still crash very occasionally; in these cases, the string representation of `p_target` was `\"<Freed Object>\"`. I followed that string to `Variant::stringify()` and found that it was made given as the string representation when the object met those conditions.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU